<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-13T00:53:25.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:53:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Former president Joseph Kabila has created a new political-military front that includes the M23 rebels. Erik Prince's security personnel were attacked in eastern DR Congo, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and wounds to former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. The ambush occurred as fighting around the M23 campaign intensified. An African Union panel is meeting President Tshisekedi in Kinshasa as part of shuttle diplomacy on the crisis. The UCDP recorded 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQWG82Q0d6UG84ZFAwZ3dMVXFMNklDbkVWU2ZhRXN3VFpFbkhpaHBfSUJDZ004ZFRTZVFNUjc3cllNVEFSa2RTa3RIdDNFTWhaQ0h5Y3U0UndhUDd3dW1NaVh6YjQ4U0UySm1scE9zV3VVRURyTE94X0xOT2lOOExOcEt3bzFwbnZNSF9NR3NfSXhhN0FiX2Fac05WeEc1MG1seHdRYVRUNGRQY3RrTEJKVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPSnRfZTRYeTRDaDlhaTVnODk3Z2xDU2wtSlUzQ0luYmNfZGlTNGRNOVBvVURsTklDYjFSUFRvT2ZEYjd3RUxLSmZQUUlNcGRCS1VYLS1NdUJ6Q0ZoU2RqemlXNWROWHNnYkFBVEc2bmp0T201UnJmaEhhMmhlRTk1c2d5eDBXc2tkcWgweWRmbW8wMThWcHIzUkhpbVZWRjhQRW1JMW1wNU5EeVVJWVhWR3gxblRqaG11UjlzajB3YjI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo Sports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE1LVlNiM0toNTdCUVNab3hjT0FtRzhZV2VCRmRlVnhoNnh1bTE4VWg4c0czajMybkd1Z1JaQUFkaVZsNWVtXzFIbkU3VFp3SmxhMzFkckh1WThuUnh0cWRVTjFJUHBmaXNTZUNQeUw2NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest n